    "Name": "Roncone",
    "Details": "The -XJ combines huge booster jets for jump capabilities with a fast striking weapons loadout in form of ER Large Lasers, Light PPCs and Artemis IV-enabled MML launchers.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Combat Computer</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.29</color></b>",
