  "StockRole": "Stealth Superheavy",
  "YangsThoughts": "Developed on Betelguese by Capellan Confderation scientists in secret on direct orders from Chancellor Liao and later produced by Hellespont Industries in the same star system, the Roncone is a superheavy design loosely based on the Battlemaster 4L. The Roncone was an attempt to build on the stealth and ECM capabilities of the Battlemaster 4L, but constant struggles with the sheer size of a Superheavy meant that the stealth was mediocre at best.",
